    "body": "Work stopped before push. Local commit 504d13b0 on issue/1672-mesh-outward contains the fix and decision record. The worktree is .claude/worktrees/issue-1672 in the Codex workspace.\n\nBoth inward_stl_import_turns_outward_and_reports_it and inward_obj_import_turns_outward_and_reports_it failed before the fix and pass after it. Restoring the old dispatcher makes both fail. Restoring only the old streaming STL block makes the STL pin fail. Restoring the fix makes both pass. No NC or CL goldens changed.\n\nThe quick gate passed in 67 seconds with caching disabled through Cargo configuration after the local sccache server failed before running tests. cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings passed. The source height trace is in the earlier comment. PR #1638 touches the same dispatcher file but changes module declarations, not the changed functions.\n\nAutomatic approval review rejected git push -u origin issue/1672-mesh-outward: approval required by policy, but AskForApproval is set to Never. No branch was pushed and no PR was created. Claim released; the issue is free again.\n",
