    "body": "Publication stopped again. Merged upstream/main cleanly into issue/1672-mesh-outward; validated HEAD is a13f6552649fa524e1a62ba69028061ee032c019. Both inward_stl_import_turns_outward_and_reports_it and inward_obj_import_turns_outward_and_reports_it pass. The quick gate passed in 132 seconds with zero failures, and cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings passed. Checks used CAMCRAFT_NO_SCCACHE=1 and build.rustc-wrapper=\"\".\n\nAutomatic approval review rejected git push -u origin issue/1672-mesh-outward: approval required by policy, but AskForApproval is set to Never. No push or PR creation occurred. The branch and .claude/worktrees/issue-1672 remain available. Claim released; the issue is free again.\n",
